# Log Incident Registry (Optional)

Use this rule when a task is explicitly about production log triage or incident follow-up.

## Before proposing fixes

1. Check whether a prior artifact exists in `.cursor/artifacts/` for the same symptom.
2. Reuse existing findings instead of duplicating analysis.
3. Distinguish code issues from infrastructure/ops-only issues.

## After incident work

- Save a timestamped incident summary to `.cursor/artifacts/`.
- Include symptom, decision, action, and verification command.

